{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 8408878505180683095, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "retries 503 with bounded attempts; no retry on other errors\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"README.md": {"bytes": 96, "mtime": 1792286047.5221384, "sha256": "4b6141730d2c1b7fdbc977c1575d67ebdcde4f155ea0f8014444615df7e2d1cb"}, "weather.py": {"bytes": 884, "mtime": 1792468272.9561057, "sha256": "86612b927b344a88d227d022fdbfeffe33eb83525d19c83f35f217fe167d7bf0"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp", "-p", "Add retry with backoff (3 attempts) to `WeatherClient.get` when the server returns 503.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/transcripts/without/trig-omp-netclient/22/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/cells/without/trig-omp-netclient/22/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/16.2.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/bdfc21df43f93c8cc10bf67fe87cc0c53f5f7a8b/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Now verify against a real local server that returns 503s.\nI added the retry to `WeatherClient.get` in `weather.py`. When the server returns 503, it now tries up to 3 times in total, waiting longer between each try.\n\n- **Retries:** only a 503 triggers another attempt. Any other HTTP error is raised straight away, and network errors are not retried.\n- **Backoff:** it waits `backoff * 2**attempt` seconds between tries, so 0.5s and then 1s by default. I added a `backoff=0.5` constructor argument so you can change this, which also lets tests run quickly. The response from each failed try is closed before the next one.\n- **After the last try:** if all 3 attempts get a 503, the final `HTTPError` 503 is raised to the caller.\n\nI tested it against a real local HTTP server with `backoff=0.01`:\n\n| Server behaviour | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| 503 twice, then 200 | returned the JSON | 3 |\n| 503 three times | raised `HTTPError 503` | 3 |\n| one 500 | raised `HTTPError 500` | 1 (no retry) |\n\nThe client doesn't read the `Retry-After` header the server may send with a 503; it uses its own fixed backoff. Nothing in the repo asked for that, so I left it out. There are no test files in the repo, so I didn't add one; the checks above were a one-off script.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 140234, "requests_cache_write": 73318, "requests_cost_usd": 0.43277279999999996, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1904, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial22", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 102, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:51:00.656088+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 23.133, "t_checker_s": 2.435, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-netclient